                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Graphics, menus, art design, everything is very crude, in a Paint MS-like level.\nControls and platforming are not good, not as solid as I thought it would be. It's like you are sliding in ice sometimes. There's some parts where you need precise jumping skills, and the controls don't help at ALL.\nStory is convoluted, I think they tried going for something complex but ended up failing.\n\nI mean, It's free, there's no reason for you to not give it a try. But I found it to be infuriating at parts, not worth the stress.",
